Bool: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 1 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above

Ordering: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..2, free 0 below / 253 above

Flags: size 2, align 1, stride 2, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 0: Bool
  .1 at 1: Bool

Settings: size 8, align 4, stride 8, niche at 4 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 4: Flags
  .1 at 0: U32

Two: size 4, align 1, stride 4, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 0: Flags
  .1 at 2: Flags

Inefficient: size 16, align 8, stride 16, niche at 12 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 12: Bool
  .1 at 0: U64
  .2 at 13: U8
  .3 at 14: @bits(4) Int
  .4 at 8: U32
  .5 at 15: @bits(4) Int

Pinned: size 32, align 8, stride 32, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 0: Bool
  .1 at 8: U64
  .2 at 16: U8
  .3 at 20: @bits(4) Int
  .4 at 24: U32
  .5 at 28: @bits(4) Int

Owned: size 2, align 1, stride 2, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 0: Bool
  .1 at 1: Bool

Pair: size 4, align 1, stride 4, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above
  .0 at 0: Owned
  .1 at 2: Owned

Maybe(Flags): size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche none
